  "goodToKnow": "Der Stürmer (die Stürmerin) is a striker or forward in football: der Mittelstürmer (centre forward). Gerd Müller, der Bomber der Nation, is Germany's most legendary Stürmer. Stürmen means to storm or attack, and der Sturm is both a storm and the attacking line. Sturm und Drang (storm and stress) was a German literary movement of the 1770s, with the young Goethe and Schiller."
